{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-016.md","record_count":10,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ஞானக்கண்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி! ராணி...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன்னம்மா. ஒரே கொண்டாட்டமா இருக்கே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேலையில்லாத் திண்டாட்டம் ஒழிந்து விட்டதப்பா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படியா? உனக்கு வேலை கிடைச்சுட்டுதா? இந்த சந்தோஷமான செய்திக்கு நான் உனக்கு என்ன பரிசு கொடுக்கப்போகிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தாங்கப்பா. இந்த ரோஜா மலரை நீங்களே என் தலையில்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹா, இல்லேப்பா! வேண்டாம்! நீங்க பார்த்து ஆனந்தப்பட முடியாத அலங்காரம் எனக்கு எதுக்கு அப்பா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உனக்கு வேலை கிடைச்சதே நான் சாப்பிட்ட மாதிரிதாம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s016-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s016","scene_ordinal":16,"transition_audit_id":"T016","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி, வாங்கப்பா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-016.md"}]}